  "description": "CR 601.2c, 115.1, 611.2a, 613.4c, 122.1a, 702.19a, 702.2a, 702.12a: Bestow Greatness gives target creature +4/+4 and trample, Maximum Overdrive puts a +1/+1 counter on target creature and gives it deathtouch and indestructible; both lapse at end of turn, the counter does not, and a noncreature permanent is no target of either",
  "note": "Alice has a Grizzly Bears (2/2), three Forests and two Swamps and both spells; bob has a Hill Giant (3/3) and an Island, carol a Serra Angel (4/4). Each spell is refused at bob's Island with its mana available. Bestow Greatness on her own Bears makes 6/6 trample and not the giant; Maximum Overdrive on bob's Giant makes 4/4 (3/3 plus a counter) with deathtouch and indestructible and not the Bears or the Angel. On bob's turn 2 the Bears are 2/2 with no trample, the Giant is 4/4 with only the counter left.",
